WEBVTT

00:08:58.558 --> 00:09:04.516
there's a whole revisionist, reformist --
whatever you call it -- tradition,

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:06.969
a trend in Islamic thinking.

00:09:06.993 --> 00:09:09.332
These were intellectuals or statesmen

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:12.376
of the 19th century,
and later, 20th century,

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:14.174
which looked at Europe, basically,

00:09:14.198 --> 00:09:16.591
and saw that Europe
has many things to admire,

00:09:16.615 --> 00:09:18.104
like science and technology.

00:09:18.128 --> 00:09:20.944
But not just that;
also democracy, parliament,

00:09:20.968 --> 00:09:22.572
the idea of representation,

00:09:22.596 --> 00:09:24.376
the idea of equal citizenship.

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:29.257
These Muslim thinkers, intellectuals
and statesmen of the 19th century,

00:09:29.281 --> 00:09:31.427
looked at Europe,
saw these things, and said,